  "obligation": "Lower legacy try/catch/catch_all/rethrow into existing shared-VM exception operations and activation handlers.",
  "representation": "LegacyTry owns one hidden exception slot and a named Body/Catch transition. The body alone is protected; arm completion branches past later catch dispatch. Catch mismatches continue in declaration order and an unmatched exception propagates outside that protected body. Lexical rethrow projects the original caught reference from its owning frame local. Modern and legacy catches share catch_values, exception_slot and protect_exception_region, preserving payload windows and original tag identity. No VM dispatch, cell, opcode, format or second executor is added.",
